## Tasks

Run these from the repo root:

- `just start {{ name }}` starts the dev server.
- `just build {{ name }}` writes the production output.
- `just test {{ name }}` runs vitest.
- `just lint` runs biome and the type check.
- `just format` applies biome fixes.

The task definitions live in `.moon/tasks/typescript.yml` and
`.moon/tasks/{{ framework }}.yml`.

## Dependencies

This unit is a member of the pnpm workspace. Add a package with
`pnpm --filter {{ name }} add <package>`. The lockfile stays at the repo root.
{% if framework == "sveltekit" %}
## Deployment

`@sveltejs/adapter-static` prerenders every route into `build/`. To deploy to a
host with its own adapter, replace the adapter in `svelte.config.js` and delete
`export const prerender = true` from `src/routes/+layout.ts`.
{% endif %}
